    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Heat Index vs. Humidity\n\nThe **Heat Index** - or the **Apparent Temperature** - is used to indicate how hot it feels when relative humidity is combined with temperature.\n\nWith increased humidity it feels hotter as indicated in the Heat Index table below."
    },
